flowchart TB
 subgraph preserve[1. Preserve and classify existing work]
  old[Existing files, manifests and job logs] --> audit[Verify checksums, IDs, settings and ownership]
  audit --> reuse[Compatible outputs: reuse]
  audit --> hist[Historical or incompatible: retain separately]
  audit --> missing[Missing stages: compute only these]
 end
 subgraph refs[2. Public-reference preparation in Nextflow]
  missing --> download[Download FASTQ + verify MD5]
  download --> trim[Trim Galore: Q20, minimum20nt]
  trim --> translate[Six frames: split ONLY at *; preserve X; keep >=30aa]
  translate --> sketch[Branchwater manysketch]
  trim --> dna[DNA sketch: no peptide cutoff]
 end
 subgraph queries[3. Query preparation in Nextflow]
  focal[Full-depth SPLASH extensions + all DE-kupl contigs] --> qtranslate[Same >=30aa stop-only translation; preserve origin IDs]
  qtranslate --> qsketch[Branchwater query sketches + empty-ID manifest]
 end
 subgraph search[4. Search and validate]
  sketch --> index[Branchwater index]
  dna --> index
  reuse --> index
  index --> many[Branchwater manysearch]
  qsketch --> many
  many --> validate[Check processed-query count, IDs, hashes and scale losses]
  validate --> results[Validated match tables + exact coverage denominators]
 end
 subgraph gate[5. Gate before production rollout]
  results --> tests[Prove reuse, resume, interruption recovery, query changes and corruption rejection]
  tests --> drain[Then drain old workers between complete runs; reconcile ownership]
  drain --> rollout[Bounded rollout + resource traces + private report]
 end
